-- title:
--   Module-finiteness of the λ-level integral closure over the node local ring
-- statement:
--   Fix a prime $q$, a valuation subring $A$ of $\overline{\mathbb Q}$, a field $k$ of characteristic $q$ with a ring homomorphism $\mathrm{red} \colon A \to k$, an element $a \in k$, and an intermediate field $K$ of $\overline{\mathbb Q}/\mathbb Q$ that is finite-dimensional over $\mathbb Q$. Write $R$ for `modularLocalizedAtPoint (1 * q) (coeffSubring A K) (redRestrict red K) a (a ^ q)`: the subring of $\overline{\mathbb Q}((\mathfrak q))$ consisting of those Laurent series $f$ for which there exist two-variable polynomials $r, s$ over $A \cap K$ with $s$ not annihilated by the evaluation sending coefficients through $\mathrm{red}$ and the two variables to $a$ and $a^{q}$, and with $f \cdot s(j, j_{q}) = r(j, j_{q})$, where the variables are evaluated at the $q$-expansions $j$ and $j_{q}$ and coefficients are included as constant series. Let $B$ be a subring of $\overline{\mathbb Q}((\mathfrak q))$ such that a Laurent series $z$ lies in $B$ exactly when $z$ belongs to `lambdaFieldOver q K`, the subfield generated by the constant series from $K$ together with $\lambda$ and its level-$q$ re-expansion, and $z$ is integral over the image of $R$ under the re-expansion $\mathfrak q \mapsto \mathfrak q^{2}$, i.e. is a root of a monic polynomial whose coefficients are such images; assume moreover that the re-expansion by $2$ carries $R$ into $B$, and that $R$ is a noetherian ring. Then, for the $R$-algebra structure on $B$ given by the re-expansion by $2$, $B$ is a finite $R$-module.
--
--   This is the finiteness of the normalisation step for the local ring, at the closed point $(a, a^{q})$ of the special fibre, of the plane model of $X_0(q)$ descended to $A \cap K$: the ring of elements of the level-two $\lambda$-field integral over the re-expanded local ring is module-finite over it. It feeds the construction of the completed local ring and its stabiliser description in [`ModularCurve.LambdaNodeLocalized.exists_subring_adicCompletion_ringEquiv_eqLocus_of_stabilizer_of_eq_zero_or_eq_1728`](thm.html#ModularCurve.LambdaNodeLocalized.exists_subring_adicCompletion_ringEquiv_eqLocus_of_stabilizer_of_eq_zero_or_eq_1728).
